WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, this is a wonderful film
where you --

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:02.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
We are about --
We see you there,

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:05.405
but then you turn into a
13-year-old version of yourself.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:07.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You're a mean boss.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very mean boss.
-I think that came across

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:10.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the clip.
You're a very nice person.

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:10.543 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Thank you.

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.512 size:78% position:39%
-Do you enjoy playing
mean people, though?

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:13.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I loved it.
-Yeah.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:14.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:17.951
You know, it's great because
you don't have to apologize.

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:19.386 line:92%
You're just rolling through.

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:22.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
I could say I was in character
and be a monster.

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:24.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
I could say I'm method.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
But no, it was fun
'cause no one was --

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know,
no one took it personally.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
They knew.
-Took it personally.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-You were in Atlanta, yes?

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was in Atlanta.
-So when you go to Atlanta,

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.235 line:92%
you did not stay at a hotel,

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:36.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is what
I would have expected.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:39.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No. I always stay
at the same place,

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:41.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is kind of an Airbnb
that I love.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:42.509 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And this time --

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:44.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, when we're
shooting "Little,"

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:48.815
the guy said, "Oh, you know,
Tyra Banks is in your building."

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:51.551
And I had done Tyra's show,
but I don't know her well.

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I was like,
"Oh, I'm gonna go say hi."

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:56.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, this particular --
She was right across the hall.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:58.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, like, right --
Like right there.

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.126 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-See you, Fred?

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:01.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Right there.

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:04.364 size:84% position:42%
So I'm gonna go over,
and I go, and I'm like,

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.366
"I don't want to yell my name."
It's a pretty big building,

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:09.002
so I don't want to say,
"Tyra, it's Regina Hall."

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:11.738 size:84% position:42%
So I go, and I'm, like,
right in the doorway.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.239 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I'm like, "It's Regina."

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:15.475 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now I didn't think
about the fact that she --

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:17.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was distorted
through the peephole.

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:21.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-So, they don't open the door.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:22.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But they're there?
-Oh, I hear.

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:24.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's trying
to disguise her voice.

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:24.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:26.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She brings her mother.
Her mother goes,

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:28.455 align:start size:94% position:6%
"How can we help?
Are you okay?"

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:31.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause they are wondering
am I woman in crisis.

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:31.491 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Uh-huh.

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:33.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Or am I woman
trying to do a setup?

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:34.294 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Gotcha.

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:36.563 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And take her
and the mother and the baby.

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:38.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
So, I go, "You know what?

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:39.165 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I'm gonna write a note."

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:41.835
I go to my --
you know, back to my apartment.

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:42.435 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I write a note.

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:45.939
But the note is in code,
because if it's not her...

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-...I don't want to put

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:49.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
my name and information.
-Gotcha.

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:50.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.143 --> 00:01:51.578
-'Cause now I'm being kidnapped.
-Yeah.

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:53.847
You've created quite a conundrum
for yourself here.

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:54.414 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:55.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then I was like,
"Why'd I do it?"

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:58.451
And what's so great about this
building is that it's airtight,

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:00.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
so the note
can't fit under the door.

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I'm literally
trying to squeeze it.

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:04.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I go home,
and I go, "You know what?

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.026
We have a hair person in common,
Oscar James."

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:08.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said,
"I'm gonna call Oscar,

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:11.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
and just say, 'Oscar, can you
tell Tyra that was me?'"

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:14.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause I signed the note "R."
-Okay.

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:14.667 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I told her
the room I was in.

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:17.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"But I'm in apartment...

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:19.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you want
to come check me out."

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:21.808
-Okay, gotcha.
-So, I just go in, and I'm like,

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Fine, whatever,"
and I get a knock.

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:25.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I look out,
and it's security.

00:02:25.545 --> 00:02:27.247 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:30.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tyra called security
and said that

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.418 line:92%
either a woman needed help

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:34.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
or was trying
to get in her apartment."

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:36.156 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:37.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then security --
And then I look,

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:39.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
she's around the corner,
and the security guard goes,

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:44.063
"Ugh, you actresses."
He was so annoyed and disgusted.

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:45.598 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:46.332 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So annoyed.

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:47.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
But then I went in
and met her mom.

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:48.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, good.
It all worked out.

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:50.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it was great, yeah.
-Good, good, good.

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:51.237 line:92%
I'm glad it has a happy ending.

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:53.439 line:92%
-It had a very happy ending.

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:55.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you spent
a lot of time in New York.

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:56.976 align:start size:94% position:6%
You went to NYU?
-I did.

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:58.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Got a Master's in journalism?
-I did.

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:01.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then you taught
at New Rochelle University.

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:03.983
-College in New Rochelle.
-College in New Rochelle.

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:06.886 line:92%
-And how were you as a teacher?

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:09.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I thought I was good.
I was strict.

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:09.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
You were strict?

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:11.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was strict
'cause I was young.

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:13.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, interesting.
Do you think younger teachers,

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:14.360 line:92%
on the whole, are stricter?

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, that particular campus
was for students

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:19.666
who were coming back to school.
-Gotcha.

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:21.834 size:78% position:39%
-I wore a head wrap.
I don't why I thought

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:25.271 size:81% position:41%
that made me look...
-Just, like, academic?

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:26.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it didn't at all.
-Yeah.

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:29.909 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It just made me look like
a woman in a head wrap.

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:31.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I wore --
Yeah, I wore a head wrap.

00:03:31.578 --> 00:03:32.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought
it made me look academic.

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:35.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then after
your life in academia,

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:37.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
you were in New York
trying to make it as an actor.

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:39.686
Were you one of those people
who had bad New York apartments

00:03:39.686 --> 00:03:42.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
over the years?
-You know what?

00:03:42.155 --> 00:03:44.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had -- Mm.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.591 --> 00:03:47.293
You know, my roommate and I
had an apartment that a crime --

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:48.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think a murder
had taken place in.

00:03:48.761 --> 00:03:50.330 align:start size:94% position:6%
But we only stayed there
three days.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
We broke the lease.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.831 --> 00:03:52.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What was it
that made you think --

00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:54.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was that yellow tape.
The yellow tape.

00:03:54.968 --> 00:03:56.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They left the yellow tape?
-The yellow tape.

00:03:56.736 --> 00:04:00.473
And I said, "We can't --
I don't know what happened,

00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:02.475 align:start size:94% position:6%
but yellow tape means
it's not good."

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:03.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:05.712
What did the Realtor say
when he showed it to you?

00:04:05.712 --> 00:04:07.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, "There's some
really nice touches."

00:04:07.914 --> 00:04:08.548 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You know what?

00:04:08.548 --> 00:04:09.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
When we looked at it,
it was fine.

00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:12.819
It was the moving in,
and I was like, "Why is there --

00:04:12.819 --> 00:04:14.520 align:start size:94% position:6%
There was a crime scene here,
sir."

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.689
-Do you think in the time
when you first looked at it

00:04:16.689 --> 00:04:21.327
to when you moved in,
that's when the crime happened?

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:23.162 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I do.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:25.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
I do. I do.
And what's crazy is,

00:04:25.198 --> 00:04:27.600
we were so excited 'cause
we wanted to get it so fast

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:28.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause the rate was so good.
-Yeah.

00:04:28.735 --> 00:04:29.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was like,
"I can't believe we're

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:32.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
getting this
for this bargain price."

00:04:32.438 --> 00:04:33.273 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:35.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
"This bargain
and murder-happened price."

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:36.109 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:38.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
But we moved after about --
after like three days.

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:41.481
-And obviously now, everything's
worked out for the best,

00:04:41.481 --> 00:04:43.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's just
so lovely to have you here.

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:45.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is always
a pleasure to see you.

00:04:45.385 --> 00:04:47.654 line:92%
Everybody, that's Regina Hall.

